<title>USA: Hadron Inc Q3 March 31 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Hadron Inc Q3 March 31 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>ALEXANDRIA, Va. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $0.03   profit	 $0.03</p>
<p> Net	   loss	    57   profit	    50</p>
<p> Revs			 4,294		    4,028</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   1,507		    1,605</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $0.02   profit	 $0.07</p>
<p> Net	   loss	    32   profit	   112</p>
<p> Revs			12,154		   14,489</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   1,506		    1,604</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company said the net loss for the third quarter and first nine months of 1997 resulted from the product development and marketing costs of HeaTreaT Pro software which exceeded $300,000.</p>
<p>Revenues for the first nine months of 1996 included approximately $3.7 million from a subsidiary that was sold.</p>
<p>Net income for the first nine months of 1996 included a extraordinary gain of $255,000 on the sale of a line of business.</p>
